y, ‘Muddled dreams’; others, ‘He made it up’; yet others, ‘He is just a poet, let him show us a sign as previous messengers did.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَضْغَـٰثُ","en_gloss":"Muddled","transliteration":"aḍghāthu","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَحْلَـٰمٍۭ","en_gloss":"dreams","transliteration":"aḥlāmin","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَلِ","en_gloss":"nay","transliteration":"bali","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"he (has) invented it","transliteration":"if'tarāhu","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"he","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَاعِرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a poet","transliteration":"shāʿirun","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلْيَأْتِنَا","en_gloss":"So let him bring us","transliteration":"falyatinā","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِـَٔايَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"biāyatin","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"like what","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُرْسِلَ","en_gloss":"was sent","transliteration":"ur'sila","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) the former","transliteration":"l-awalūna","verse_key":"21:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:5"}]},{"verse_key":"21:6","surah":21,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"مَآ ءَامَنَتْ قَبْلَهُم مِّن قَرْيَةٍ أَهْلَكْنَـٰهَآ ۖ أَفَهُمْ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But of the communities We destroyed before them not a single one believed. Will these now believe?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنَتْ","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanat","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَبْلَهُم","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"qablahum","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَرْيَةٍ","en_gloss":"town","transliteration":"qaryatin","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَهْلَكْنَـٰهَآ ۖ","en_gloss":"which We destroyed","transliteration":"ahlaknāhā","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَفَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so will they","transliteration":"afahum","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"21:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:6"}]},{"verse_key":"21:7","surah":21,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَا قَبْلَكَ إِلَّا رِجَالًا نُّوحِىٓ إِلَيْهِمْ ۖ فَسْـَٔلُوٓا۟ أَهْلَ ٱلذِّكْرِ إِن كُنتُمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And even before your time [Prophet], all the messengers We sent were only men We inspired–– if you [disbelievers] do not know, ask people who know the Scripture––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَبْلَكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablaka","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رِجَالًۭا","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"rijālan","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُّوحِىٓ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"nūḥī","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَسْـَٔلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"So ask","transliteration":"fasalū","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَهْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) people","transliteration":"ahla","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Reminder","transliteration":"l-dhik'ri","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"21:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:7"}]},{"verse_key":"21:8","surah":21,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا جَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ جَسَدًا لَّا يَأْكُلُونَ ٱلطَّعَامَ وَمَا كَانُوا۟ خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We did not give them bodies that ate no food, nor were they immortal.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We made them","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhum","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَسَدًۭا","en_gloss":"bodies","transliteration":"jasadan","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَأْكُلُونَ","en_gloss":"eating","transliteration":"yakulūna","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلطَّعَامَ","en_gloss":"the food","transliteration":"l-ṭaʿāma","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"immortals","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"21:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:8"}]},{"verse_key":"21:9","surah":21,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ صَدَقْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْوَعْدَ فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُمْ وَمَن نَّشَآءُ وَأَهْلَكْنَا ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We fulfilled Our promise to them in the end: We saved them and those We wished to save, and We destroyed those who exceeded all bounds.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَدَقْنَـٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"We fulfilled (for) them","transliteration":"ṣadaqnāhumu","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْوَعْدَ","en_gloss":"the promise","transliteration":"l-waʿda","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We saved them","transliteration":"fa-anjaynāhum","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whom","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَّشَآءُ","en_gloss":"We willed","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَهْلَكْنَا","en_gloss":"and We destroyed","transliteration":"wa-ahlaknā","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","en_gloss":"the transgressors","transliteration":"l-mus'rifīna","verse_key":"21:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:9"}]},{"verse_key":"21:10","surah":21,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ أَنزَلْنَآ إِلَيْكُمْ كِتَـٰبًا فِيهِ ذِكْرُكُمْ ۖ أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And now We have sent down to you [people] a Scripture to remind you. Will you not use your reason?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We (have) sent down","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"a Book","transliteration":"kitāban","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذِكْرُكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) your mention","transliteration":"dhik'rukum","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"Then will not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you use reason","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"21:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:10"}]}]